This project is a reimplementation inspired by the design and feature set of
sky22333/hubproxy (MIT, Copyright (c) sky22333). The program structure is
written from scratch on the Go standard library; the regular expression used to
rewrite GitHub URLs inside shell scripts and the list of proxied GitHub /
Hugging Face hosts are taken from the original project.

